    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31425" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nŭmistro</span></b> , ōnis,
			f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city in Lucania</i>, near the mod. <i>Muro</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 27, 2, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Front. 2, 2,
				6</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nŭmistrāni</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nŭ-mestrāni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of</i> Numistro, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 11,
				15, § 98</span></i>.</div>
